138
00:04:52,937 --> 00:04:54,095
people realize.

139
00:04:54,275 --> 00:04:55,928
After World War Two,

140
00:04:55,928 --> 00:04:59,398
both Chevrolet and Ford launched new truck

141
00:04:59,398 --> 00:04:59,894
lines.

142
00:05:00,074 --> 00:05:03,617
Chevrolet introduced its Advance Design trucks in

143
00:05:03,617 --> 00:05:05,136
nineteen forty-seven.

144
00:05:05,316 --> 00:05:07,767
Ford followed with the F-Series in nineteen

145
00:05:07,767 --> 00:05:08,451
forty-eight.

146
00:05:08,631 --> 00:05:09,896
From that moment,

147
00:05:09,896 --> 00:05:12,500
the two brands have fought over the

148
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:15,179
same buyers for almost eighty years.

149
00:05:15,529 --> 00:05:18,061
