157
00:05:32,984 --> 00:05:36,245
For GM, that headline became a permanent

158
00:05:36,245 --> 00:05:36,816
target.

159
00:05:36,996 --> 00:05:39,594
Much of the advertising war since then

160
00:05:39,594 --> 00:05:41,919
