success.

177
00:06:11,589 --> 00:06:14,079
But it explains why GM never stopped

178
00:06:14,079 --> 00:06:14,701
fighting.

179
00:06:15,051 --> 00:06:17,042
Dodge, the ancestor of Ram,

180
00:06:17,042 --> 00:06:19,328
was a distant third for most of

181
00:06:19,328 --> 00:06:20,066
that time.

182
00:06:20,246 --> 00:06:21,508
Its trucks were tough,

183
00:06:21,508 --> 00:06:23,402
but they lacked the image and the

184
00:06:23,402 --> 00:06:25,180
dealer reach of Ford and Chevy.

185
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:28,096
That changed in nineteen ninety-four,

186
00:06:28,096 --> 00:06:30,832
