195
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:49,081
the Cummins diesel engine.

196
00:06:49,261 --> 00:06:52,010
It gave Dodge a reputation for towing

197
00:06:52,010 --> 00:06:55,501
and durability that its light-duty trucks never

198
00:06:55,501 --> 00:06:55,798
had.

199
00:06:55,978 --> 00:06:57,847
And then came another twist.

200
00:06:58,027 --> 00:06:59,124
In twenty ten,

201
00:06:59,124 --> 00:07:01,945
Chrysler split Ram off from Dodge as

202
00:07:01,945 --> 00:07:03,042
its own brand.

203
00:07:03,222 --> 00:07:05,359
A truck name became a company.

204
00:07:05,539 --> 00:07:08,037
The third player in the rivalry finally

205
00:07:08,037 --> 00:07:09,382
