212
00:07:24,272 --> 00:07:27,808
plus large touchscreens and luxury interiors.

213
00:07:27,988 --> 00:07:29,556
The idea was simple.

214
00:07:29,736 --> 00:07:32,458
Many truck buyers drive their trucks every

215
00:07:32,458 --> 00:07:34,013
day with their families,

216
00:07:34,013 --> 00:07:36,023
