220
00:07:40,703 --> 00:07:42,094
In twenty nineteen,

221
00:07:42,094 --> 00:07:43,779
according to The Drive,

222
00:07:43,779 --> 00:07:46,927
Ram sold six hundred thirty-three thousand,

223
00:07:46,927 --> 00:07:49,270
