225
00:07:50,914 --> 00:07:55,008
The Silverado sold five hundred seventy-five thousand,

226
00:07:55,008 --> 00:07:55,918
six hundred.

227
00:07:56,098 --> 00:07:57,986
For the first time in history,

228
00:07:57,986 --> 00:08:00,124
Ram had pushed Chevy out of second

229
00:08:00,124 --> 00:08:01,508
place for a full year.

230
00:08:01,688 --> 00:08:03,476
The underdog had bitten back.

231
00:08:03,827 --> 00:08:05,080
What made the difference?

232
00:08:05,260 --> 00:08:08,304
The twenty nineteen Ram fifteen hundred was

233
00:08:08,304 --> 00:08:09,508
a new generation,

234
00:08:09,508 --> 00:08:12,197
launched with a high-quality interior,

235
00:08:12,197 --> 00:08:13,472
a big touchscreen,

236
00:08:13,472 --> 00:08:14,746
and a smooth ride.

237
00:08:14,926 --> 00:08:17,075
Many reviewers praised it as one of

238
00:08:17,075 --> 00:08:19,593
the most comfortable trucks in its class.

239
00:08:19,773 --> 00:08:20,980
At the same time,

240
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:23,821
the new Silverado had a mixed reception,

241
00:08:23,821 --> 00:08:25,810
especially for its interior.

242
00:08:25,990 --> 00:08:28,691
Buyers noticed, and they voted with their

243
00:08:28,691 --> 00:08:29,218
