246
00:08:33,707 --> 00:08:37,048
Silverado plus Sierra in twenty nineteen added

247
00:08:37,048 --> 00:08:38,501
up to more than Ram.

248
00:08:38,681 --> 00:08:40,411
But the message had landed.

249
00:08:40,591 --> 00:08:42,799
The truck market was no longer a

250
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:45,351
two-way fight between Ford and Chevy.

251
00:08:45,531 --> 00:08:46,957
It was a three-way war,

252
00:08:46,957 --> 00:08:49,002
and the smallest of the three had

253
00:08:49,002 --> 00:08:50,675
shown it could win a round.

254
00:08:51,025 --> 00:08:52,971
Now some of the biggest moments of

255
00:08:52,971 --> 00:08:53,544
the fight.

256
00:08:53,724 --> 00:08:55,039
In twenty fifteen,

257
00:08:55,039 --> 00:08:57,814
Ford built the body of the F-one-fifty

258
00:08:57,814 --> 00:08:58,982
out of aluminum,

259
00:08:58,982 --> 00:09:00,005
to cut weight.

260
00:09:00,185 --> 00:09:02,112
Chevrolet saw an opening.

261
00:09:02,292 --> 00:09:04,808
It ran ads comparing its steel truck

262
00:09:04,808 --> 00:09:06,835
