266
00:09:13,090 --> 00:09:15,609
Ford pushed back and kept selling.

267
00:09:15,789 --> 00:09:20,108
The aluminum F-one-fifty stayed the best-selling truck.

268
00:09:20,458 --> 00:09:22,673
The twist is that both sides were

269
00:09:22,673 --> 00:09:23,546
