270
00:09:23,726 --> 00:09:26,640
Aluminum saved weight and did not rust.

271
00:09:26,820 --> 00:09:29,605
Steel was cheaper to repair in some

272
00:09:29,605 --> 00:09:30,082
cases.

273
00:09:30,262 --> 00:09:31,418
Ten years later,

274
00:09:31,418 --> 00:09:33,513
the debate had a new chapter.

275
00:09:33,693 --> 00:09:35,944
In September twenty twenty-five,

276
00:09:35,944 --> 00:09:38,476
a fire at the Novelis aluminum plant

277
00:09:38,476 --> 00:09:41,007
in New York disrupted Ford's supply.

278
00:09:41,187 --> 00:09:43,844
According to Automotive Logistics,

279
00:09:43,844 --> 00:09:47,986
Ford's chief financial officer confirmed a production

280
00:09:47,986 --> 00:09:51,346
loss of about one hundred thousand vehicles

281
00:09:51,346 --> 00:09:53,378
across twenty twenty-five.

282
00:09:53,728 --> 00:09:56,154
What did this teach the industry?

283
00:09:56,334 --> 00:09:58,774
That a rival's weakness can become your

284
